# Build context for the server image (context = repo root; the web image
# builds from web/ with its own web/.dockerignore). crates/telmoni/Dockerfile
# COPYs only `Cargo.toml Cargo.lock` + `crates/`, but the whole context is
# uploaded to the daemon minus what's excluded here — so keep the heavy,
# never-needed trees out (target/ alone can be tens of GB locally).

# ── Rust build output — the big one; nothing here belongs in the context ──────
target/
.sqlx/

# ── Trees the server image never needs ────────────────────────────────────────
web/
deploy/
sdk/
mobile/
.github/

# ── Git ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.git/
.gitignore
.gitattributes

# ── Secrets and credentials ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Every real value reaches a container through its environment at run time;
# nothing should be baked in.
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.cert
*.p12
*.pfx
*.crt
application_default_credentials.json

# ── Build artifacts ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/build
**/coverage

# ── Test artifacts ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
**/__tests__/
**/*.test.ts
**/*.spec.ts
**/test-results/
**/playwright-report/
**/blob-report/

# ── CI / tooling (not needed at runtime) ──────────────────────────────────────
Makefile
docker-compose.yml
.pre-commit-config.yaml
ENGINE_VERSION

# ── Documentation ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.md
docs/

# ── Editor / OS ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.swo

# ── Logs ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
**/*.log
npm-debug.log*

# ── TypeScript ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
**/*.tsbuildinfo
